WHAT: Adds .cargo/config.toml to patch sonatina dependencies to local paths.
Also updates Cargo.lock to remove git source pins for sonatina crates.

WHY: Enables fe to build against the local sonatina checkout. Previously
the cargo patch had to be injected temporarily.

GAS IMPACT: Unexpected regression across all contracts (+46 to +251 gas).
This is likely a Cargo compilation artifact from the Cargo.lock changes
(removing git source pins changes dependency resolution order, which can
affect code generation through different inlining decisions or layout).
The sonatina code is identical to step 11.

TEAM NOTES: This regression is an artifact of the build system change,
not a real compiler regression. The Cargo.lock diff removes git source
annotations, which may cause Cargo to resolve dependencies slightly
differently. The gas numbers from step 13 onward are the true baseline
for Fe-side changes.
